          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಟ್ರಾಲಿ — ṭrāli — \"a trolley\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವಿಮಾನ ನಿಲ್ದಾಣದಲ್ಲಿ ಟ್ರಾಲಿ ಉಚಿತ. vimāna nildāṇadalli ṭrāli ucita. At the airport the trolley is free."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A luggage trolley at a station, or a hand cart in a shop."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಟ್ರಾಲಿ (ṭrāli) is a loan from English trolley, a small cart pushed by hand."
            }
          ]
        },
