          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಕೈಸಾಮಾನು — kaisāmānu — \"hand luggage\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಕೈಸಾಮಾನು ಏಳು ಕಿಲೋಗಿಂತ ಹೆಚ್ಚು ಇರಬಾರದು. kaisāmānu ēḷu kilōginta heccu irabāradu. Hand luggage must not weigh more than seven kilos."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಕೈ, hand, plus ಸಾಮಾನು, luggage: the bag you keep with you on a plane or a bus."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಕೈಸಾಮಾನು (kaisāmānu) is a Kannada compound of native kai, \"hand\", and ಸಾಮಾನು, \"luggage, things\", which is usually traced to Persian sāmān, \"goods, equipment\"."
            }
          ]
        },
