          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಭರ್ತಿಯಾಗು — bhartiyāgu — \"to fill up; to be full\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹಬ್ಬದ ಕಾರಣ ಎಲ್ಲಾ ಬಸ್ಸುಗಳು ಭರ್ತಿಯಾದವು. habbada kāraṇa ellā bassugaḷu bhartiyādavu. Because of the festival all the buses filled up."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (it …): ಭರ್ತಿಯಾಯಿತು, bhartiyāyitu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಭರ್ತಿ alone means full or filled; ಭರ್ತಿ ಮಾಡು is to fill in, as a form."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಭರ್ತಿಯಾಗು (bhartiyāgu) joins bharti, \"full, filled\", usually traced to Hindustani bhartī, \"filling, recruitment\", and the native verb ಆಗು, to become."
            }
          ]
        },
